{"id":"975ad013f3f24228","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-membership-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Membership Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-membership-closed-class — ZFC Membership Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-membership-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-membership-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-membership-closed-class — ZFC Membership Closed Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-membership-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-membership-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-membership-closed-class — ZFC Membership Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in V\">\\(C\\in V\\)</span>（本谓词的 ZFC 对象语言版本取集合编码的类）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipClosedClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipClosedClass}_S\\)</span> is the one-place set predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}membership\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{MembershipClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}membership\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{MembershipClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该条件正是集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的传递性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in C\">\\(x\\in C\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的每个元素仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 中。</li>\n<li>对真类使用同一公式时，应理解为相应的一阶公式模式，而不能把宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 当作集合并对其取幂集。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MembershipClosedClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}membership\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{MembershipClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in x\\;(y\\in C)","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":929,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee5e8d70ab0f45d0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MembershipClosedClass}_S$ is the one-place predicate from [[58-df-zfc-membership-closed-class]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2681","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-membership-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-membership-closed-class]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}